                "obs-63f6779a0d713cba625784b1"
              ],
              "statement": "分部收入并非全部直接归属；部分合同收入按相对价值在分部间分配，分配基础可为实际价格、单独售价或估计成本加成。",
              "citations": [
                {
                  "source_snapshot_id": "source-0019ae7ba0f6e3b63f944782",
                  "block_id": "block-001211-94df82c9",
                  "quote": "Revenue from certain contracts is allocated among the segments based on the relative value of the underlying products and services, which can include allocation based on actual prices charged, prices when sold separately, or estimated costs plus a profit margin.",
                  "source_start": 216
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "record_ids": [
                "obs-d2acdf2c846eea79d969011b",
